{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.213, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:32.406Z", "t_ms": 7159, "delta": " web environments using a dynamic, multi-step planning-action-reflection loop rather than a static lookup [C6, C7]."}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.468, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:32.616Z", "t_ms": 7369, "delta": " \n\nThe process is carried out as follows:\n\n* **Initial Planning:** Upon receiving the user query $q$, the agent generates"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.648, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:32.841Z", "t_ms": 7594, "delta": " an initial plan $\\pi_0 = \\text{Plan}(q)$ outlining its strategy for acquiring information from the web"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.778, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:32.961Z", "t_ms": 7714, "delta": " [C6, C7].\n* **Iterative Search Trajectory:** The agent executes an iterative trajectory of up to"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.925, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:33.117Z", "t_ms": 7870, "delta": " $T$ steps [C6, C7]. At each step $t$:\n  * **Reflection and Plan"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.179, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:33.372Z", "t_ms": 8125, "delta": " Updating:** The agent reviews its latest observation $o_t$ alongside its memory/previous trajectory $h_t$ to update"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.313, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:33.506Z", "t_ms": 8259, "delta": " its plan: $\\pi_{t+1} = \\text{Reflect}(o_t, h_t"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.593, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:33.720Z", "t_ms": 8472, "delta": ", \\pi_t)$ [C6, C7].\n  * **Tool Execution (Action):** Driven"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.68, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:33.873Z", "t_ms": 8626, "delta": " by the updated plan, the agent selects and executes an action using available tools: $a_{t+1} = \\text{Act"}}
