{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.192, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:34.385Z", "t_ms": 9138, "delta": " time tool), and a termination action [C6, C7].\n  * **Observation:** Each action returns an observation $"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.323, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:34.516Z", "t_ms": 9269, "delta": "o_{t+1}$, such as search result snippets or raw webpage content [C6, C7].\n*"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.617, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:34.755Z", "t_ms": 9508, "delta": " **Termination and Output:** The loop continues until the agent determines that the gathered evidence is sufficient, or until it reaches the maximum step limit"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.724, "data": {"request_id": "7164b74c67de", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:34.917Z", "t_ms": 9669, "delta": " $T$ [C6, C7]. The final output of this stage is an ordered sequence of raw web observations $"}}
